:[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["費用・手間"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["月々200〜300元から、グレードによっては1,000元以上まで様々です"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["効果"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["どのブランドが最高かというランキングを公表している公的機関は存在しないため、本書ではブランドの推奨は行いません。確認可能な情報は2つのカテゴリーのみです。一つは国家市場監督管理総局による製品品質の抜き打ち検査通知。もう一つは規制当局による個別事案の調査結果です。2026年6月に「乳幼児用紙おむつのホルムアミド問題」が注目されて以降、市場監督管理総局が主導して合同調査チームを立ち上げ、調査を行いました"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["出典"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["市场监管总局 (2026-06-22). 市场监管总局牵头成立联合调查组核查「婴幼儿纸尿裤甲酰胺问题」：「针对媒体反映的\"婴幼儿纸尿裤甲酰胺问题\"，市场监管总局、工业和信息化部、国家卫生健康委、国家疾控局高度重视，成立联合调查组，核查婴幼儿纸尿裤甲酰胺有关问题，并依法依规处理。有关情况将及时公布。」. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.samr.gov.cn/xw/zj/art/2026/art_78c0425db7604b27bd7a3f36ba319975.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.samr.gov.cn/xw/zj/art/2026/art_78c0425db7604b27bd7a3f36ba319975.html"]},"；中国政府网转载. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/202606/content_7072931.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/202606/content_7072931.htm"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.samr.gov.cn/xw/zj/art/2026/art_78c0425db7604b27bd7a3f36ba319975.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["出典を開く"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"